track 2 of Unbreakable Momentum
Instrumental-only dark synth-rock track at 80 BPM built on a firm, repeating midrange riff that establishes boundaries without aggression, Drums are heavy and precise—deep kick, deliberate snare, restrained hi-hats—locking an unbreakable pocket that never rushes, Bass doubles the rail with a thick, confident line that reinforces authority and forward motion, Guitars and synths stay focused and minimal, cycling short motifs that feel resolute rather than explosive, Harmonic tension remains unresolved, conveying insistence without hostility, No vocals, no drops, no chaos—the groove holds its shape and moves forward without asking permission
